Description:
  Runs the core generators every new Rails app should have

  Sets up Slim, Webpack, Optics, SimpleForm, Tom Select, testing (RSpec &
  friends), Turbo, flash messages, GitHub config, README, linters, Heroku
  deployment, Sentry, and Lograge. It also installs the agent skills for
  resource_for and TaskTools. The result is an app that is ready to push
  directly to Heroku.

  Pass an icon library flag (--material, --phosphor, --tabler, --feather,
  --lucide, or --custom) to choose the Optics icons up front.

  Pass --skip-deployable to skip Heroku, Sentry, and Lograge.

Example:
  rails generate rolemodel:core_setup --material
